// lib/unicode.warp casefold (CaseFolding.txt C+F, no Turkic T), is_normalized and unicode_normalize on texts; expected values
// from python3 15.1.0 (str.casefold, unicodedata). Generated by test/unicode/gen_unicode_tables.py
// full folding: one code point to several (status F), and the simple ones (status C)
