// İ folds to i and U+0307 (status F), I to i: the Turkic mappings (status T, İ to i, I to ı) are not applied
'use unicode; codepoint_numbers(casefold(text_of_codepoints([304])))'	[105, 775]
'use unicode; casefold("I")'	"i"
'use unicode; casefold("Straße") == casefold("STRASSE")'	true
